HONESTY IS THE BEST POLICY - THE ONLY POLICY





Our Honesty Policy

Honesty is the foundation of trust. This policy sets out what we expect from everyone on the team.

Principles

* Tell the truth. Share accurate information, even when it is uncomfortable.
* Own mistakes. Report errors early and openly so they can be fixed quickly.
* Be transparent. Explain decisions and the reasons behind them.
* Don’t mislead. Avoid half-truths, exaggeration, and leaving out facts that matter.
* Respect confidences. Honesty does not mean sharing private information that isn’t ours to share.

In practice

* Give feedback that is kind, direct, and specific.
* Say “I don’t know” rather than guessing.
* Speak up when something looks wrong, with no fear of blame.

